 ],
 "notes": "blend mask mode: shown when drawn & raster need !IOP_FLAGS_NO_MASKS; parametric needs blend colorspace Lab or RGB; whole row hidden if module hides enable button (not machine-readable). fulcrum: shown when blend colorspace == RGB (scene); mode in {multiply, divide, addition, subtract, RGB red/green/blue channel, subtract/divide inverse} (not machine-readable). output: shown when output row only when 'show output channels' is on or already used (not machine-readable). details threshold: shown when image is raw (dt_image_is_rawprepare_supported, :3250) (not machine-readable). blend colorspace (blending options menu): default 0 (0 = the module's default colorspace). blend colorspace (blending options menu): shown when only when parametric masks are supported (not machine-readable)."
}
